PYTHONBOTS CORE — LICENCE

This repository publishes the source of pythonbots-core so that anyone can read it, and so that
each release is a dated, public fact. Publication grants no rights: no licence to run, copy,
modify or redistribute the software is granted by this repository, by PyPI, or by any other
channel. A licence is issued only with an order, on the terms below, and is recorded in that
order's LICENSE-ADDENDUM.

Third-party components are listed in NOTICE and keep their own licences.

