1. DEFINITIONS
   "Core" means the Python distribution "pythonbots-core", delivered as the wheel file
   in "wheels/" of the Delivered Work and installed from it, including its files, version,
   manifest and migrations, as identified in the Addendum by version, manifest fingerprint
   and wheel sha256.
   "Delivered Work" means the software delivered by the Licensor to the
   Licensee under the order identified in the Addendum — that order and the
   files attached to its delivery — together with every later evolution of
   that same software made by or for the Licensee outside the Core.
   "Licensee" means the person or entity identified in the Addendum.
   "Instance" means one running copy of the Delivered Work, on any machine,
   for any environment (production, staging, test).

